==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{surf|ru|заступи́ть|-ник}}. Cognate with {{cog|bg|застъпник||[[intercessor]], [[mediator]]}} (which corresponds {{m+|ru|посре́дник}}). Compare typologically {{m+|la|intercessor}}.

===Pronunciation===
